cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, as well as GaiaXPy."
type: software
title: "gaiaxpy-batch"
abstract: >-
  Batch download of Gaia DR3 BP/RP (XP) spectra for lists of source IDs of any length.
  The XP continuous spectra are downloaded from the Gaia archive with astroquery, in chunks within the
  archive's request limits, in parallel, with retries, and calibrated or converted with GaiaXPy.
  The spectra are saved as csv tables and, optionally, one fits or txt file per object.
authors:
